<title>USA: FGIC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</title>
<headline>FGIC qualifies five muni issues for insurance.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>FGIC said Tuesday it qualified for bond insurance the following five municipal issues scheduled for competitive sale today:</p>
<p>--Manchester Township, N.J., $9.3 million of GO bonds.</p>
<p>--Newark, N.J., $39.414 million GOs.</p>
<p>--Newark, N.J., $15.102 million GO water utility bonds.</p>
<p>--Newark, N.J., $5 million redevelopment bonds.</p>
<p>--Cobleskill-Rich Central School District, N.Y., $9 million GOs.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
